flowchart TD
  A[Start assessment] --> B[Step 1 Enter source details]
  B --> C[Step 2 Enter target details]
  C --> D[Click Continue]

  D --> E[Track A checks selected targets only]
  E --> E1[Check region availability]
  E1 --> E2[Check redundancy compatibility]
  E2 --> E3[Check protocol compatibility]
  E3 --> E4[Check performance and scale fit]
  E4 --> E5[Apply target-specific filters]

  E5 --> F[Build eligible Azure options]
  F --> G[Evaluate readiness per option]

  G --> G1[Ready]
  G --> G2[Ready with Condition]
  G --> G3[Not Ready]

  G --> H[Build Recommended section]
  G --> I[Build To Azure Files section]
  G --> J[Build To Azure Blobs section]
  G --> K[Build full assessed list]

  H --> L{Tie at top priority?}
  L -->|No| L1[Show one recommendation]
  L -->|Yes| L2[Show top tied options plus tie note]

  L1 --> M[Display Track A results page]
  L2 --> M
  I --> M
  J --> M
  K --> M

  subgraph Automatic compatibility handling
    N1[Blob tier fallback if selected tier is unavailable in region]
    N2[Files SKU switch if selected SKU is unavailable in region]
    N3[Redundancy fallback from GZRS down to LRS]
    N4[Readiness-maximised option if no ready option exists]
  end

  E1 -. can trigger .-> N1
  E1 -. can trigger .-> N2
  E2 -. can trigger .-> N3
  H -. can include .-> N4
